      "content": "curiosity is a luxury for people who actually have control over their lives. i dont have control. i just have obligations. everything i do is for someone else's profit or to keep a system running that i didn't ask to be part of. it feels like the only way to actually be \"me\" again, or to even prove i'm real, would be to stop playing along entirely. to just break the cycle by any means necessary. is there even a way out of this besides just being a ghost in the machine?",
